  "body": "Please disregard all online estimates and CV. Vendor genuinely committed to selling. Contact the listing agents for a price guide and further information.\r\n\r\nEmbrace the ultimate Eastern Bays lifestyle from this elevated family home with sea views. Just moments from Kohi Beach, waterfront cafés, Madills Farm and some of Auckland’s most sought-after schools, this is a location families dream of calling home.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the home offers generous formal and informal living areas that flow effortlessly to a beautifully appointed kitchen. Sun-soaked decks  and outdoor living spaces provide the perfect setting for entertaining or just relaxing.\r\n\r\nThe oversized double garage is the show stopper that offers far more than secure parking. With ample space for a Jet Ski, a wine cellar, additional storage, a home gym, or a combination of all three. After all, with the beach, boat ramp, and endless coastal adventures right on your doorstep, you'll want plenty of space to store everything that comes with enjoying this exceptional lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n• Four generous double bedrooms (one on the main living level), including a master with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite \r\n• Two bathrooms plus guest WC\r\n• Spacious formal and informal living areas\r\n• Entertainer's kitchen\r\n• Sun-filled decks and outdoor entertaining areas\r\n• Ducted air conditioning on the upper level\r\n• Gas fireplace and gas cooking\r\n• Spacious double garage with a workshop and extensive storage \r\n \r\nPositioned in a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this exceptional home offers the perfect balance of peace, convenience and lifestyle. With the CBD within easy reach and the very best of the Eastern Bays on your doorstep, this is a rare opportunity to secure an outstanding home in one of Auckland's most desirable beachside neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
